\id PHM
\ide UTF-8
\rem Passage-aware semantic alignment (custom zsem milestones). Source: Textus Receptus (Scrivener 1894). zsem-s/zsem-e wrap the Tamil realization of one semantic unit; zsem-i = implicit or morphology-only realization; zsem-nl = source unit not located in its passage. x-support on a word marks a Tamil word outside any unit. All states AI_PROPOSED.
\h பிலேமோன்
\toc1 அப்போஸ்தலனாகிய பவுல் பிலேமோனுக்கு எழுதின நிருபம்
\toc2 பிலேமோன்
\toc3 பிலே
\mt பிலேமோன்
\is ஆசிரியர்
\ip பிலேமோன் புத்தகத்தை எழுதியவர் அப்போஸ்தலன் பவுல் (1: 1). பிலேமோனுக்கு பவுல் எழுதிய கடிதத்தில் ஒநேசிமுவை பிலேமோனிடம் மீண்டும் அனுப்புகிறார், மற்றும் கொலோசெயர் 4: 9 ல் ஒநேசிமு தீகிக்குவுடன் கொலேசே பட்டணத்திற்கு வருபவராக அடையாளம் காணப்படுகிறார். (கொலோசெயர்களுக்கு நிருபத்தைக் கொடுக்கும் நபர்) பவுல் இந்தக் கடிதத்தை தனது சொந்தக் கையால் எழுதுவதன்மூலம் இது எவ்வளவு முக்கியமானது என்பதை காட்டுவது சுவராசியமான ஒன்றாகும்.
\is எழுதப்பட்ட காலம் மற்றும் இடம்
\ip ஏறக்குறைய கிபி 60 காலகட்டத்தில் எழுதப்பட்டது.
\ip பவுல் ரோமில் பிலேமோன் நிருபத்தை எழுதினார், பிலேமோனுக்கு கடிதம் எழுதப்பட்ட சமயத்தில் பவுல் கைதியாக இருந்தார்.
\is யாருக்காக எழுதப்பட்டது
\ip பிலேமோன், அப்பியாள், அர்க்கிப்பு மற்றும் அர்க்கிப்புவின் வீட்டில் கூடிவரும் சபைக்கு பவுல் கடிதம் எழுதினார். நிருபத்தின் உள்ளடக்கத்திலிருந்து, அது முதன்மையான உத்தேசிக்கப்பட்ட வாசகர் பிலேமோன் என்று தெளிவாக தெரிகிறது.
\is எழுதப்பட்ட நோக்கம்
\ip பவுல் ஒநேசிமுவை திரும்பவும் தண்டனையின்றி சேர்த்துக் கொள்வதற்காக பிலேமோனை சம்மதிக்க செய்தல் (10-12, 17). (அடிமையாகிய ஒனேசிமு தன் எஜமான் பிலேமோனிடமிருந்து திருடிவிட்டு தப்பி ஓடிவிட்டார்) மேலும் ஒனேசிமுவை அடிமையாக அல்ல, ஒரு பிரியமான சகோதரனாக (15-16) பிலேமோன் ஏற்றுக்கொள்ளும்படி பவுல் விரும்பினார். ஒனேசிமு இன்னும் பிலேமோனுடைய சொத்தாக இருந்தான், மற்றும் ஒனேசிமு தனது எஜமானிடம் திரும்புவதற்கான வழியை சுமூகமாக்குவதற்காக பவுல் எழுதினார். பவுல் அவரிடம் சாட்சி கொடுத்ததால், ஒநேசிமு ஒரு கிறிஸ்தவராக மாறினார் (1: 10).
\is மையக் கருத்து
\ip மன்னிப்பு
\iot பொருளடக்கம்
\io1 1. வாழ்த்துரை — 1:1-3
\io1 2. நன்றி கூறுதல் — 1:4-7
\io1 3. ஒனேசிமுவுக்காக மன்றாடுதல் — 1:8-22
\io1 4. இறுதி வார்த்தைகள் — 1:23-25
\c 1
\cl அத்தியாயம் 1
\p
\v 1 \zsem-s |x-unit="U1.2" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:1#02-03-04" x-content="δέσμιος Χριστοῦ Ἰησοῦ" x-strong="G1198,G5547,G2424" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="RELATION" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="genitive 'prisoner of Christ' → -க்காக 'for the sake of Christ'; standard rendering"\*\w கிறிஸ்து|strong="G5547" x-morph="N-GSM-T"\w* \w இயேசுவுக்காக|strong="G2424" x-morph="N-GSM-P"\w* \w சிறைச்சாலையில்|strong="G1198" x-morph="N-NSM"\w* \w கட்டப்பட்டவனாக|strong="G1198" x-morph="N-NSM"\w*\zsem-e\* \w இருக்கிற|x-support="GRAMMATICALLY_REQUIRED" x-reason="copula இருக்கிற"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U1.1" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:1#01" x-content="Παῦλος" x-strong="G3972" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w பவுலும்|strong="G3972" x-morph="N-NSM-P" x-carrier="U1.3"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U1.5" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:1#07-08" x-content="ὁ ἀδελφὸς" x-strong="G3588,G0080" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w சகோதரனாகிய|strong="G3588,G0080" x-morph="T-NSM,N-NSM"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U1.4" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:1#06" x-content="Τιμόθεος" x-strong="G5095" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w தீமோத்தேயும்|strong="G2532,G5095" x-morph="CONJ,N-NSM-P" x-carrier="U1.3"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U1.10" x-type="REFERENT" x-src="PHM 1:1#14" x-content="ἡμῶν" x-strong="G3165" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w எங்களுக்குப்|strong="G3165" x-morph="P-1GP"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U1.7" x-type="ATTRIBUTE" x-src="PHM 1:1#10-11" x-content="τῷ ἀγαπητῷ" x-strong="G3588,G0027" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w பிரியமுள்ளவனும்|strong="G3588,G0027" x-morph="T-DSM,A-DSM"\w*\zsem-e\* \w சுவிசேஷ|x-support="EXPLICITATION_SUPPORTED" x-reason="சுவிசேஷ 'gospel' specifies the shared work; cf. 1:13 εὐαγγελίου"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U1.9" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:1#13" x-content="συνεργῷ" x-strong="G4904" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="வேலையின் உடன் வேலையாளுமாக; Tamil adds 'gospel' (t11) as the work — see support"\*\w வேலையின்|strong="G2532,G4904" x-morph="CONJ,A-DSM"\w* \w உடன்|strong="G2532,G4904" x-morph="CONJ,A-DSM"\w* \w வேலையாளுமாக|strong="G2532,G4904" x-morph="CONJ,A-DSM" x-carrier="U1.8"\w*\zsem-e\* \w இருக்கிற|x-support="GRAMMATICALLY_REQUIRED" x-reason="copula"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U1.6" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:1#09" x-content="Φιλήμονι" x-strong="G5371" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w பிலேமோனுக்கும்|strong="G5371" x-morph="N-DSM-P"\w*\zsem-e\*,\zsem-i |x-unit="U1.3" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:1#05" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-உம் … -உம் on பவுலும் / தீமோத்தேயும்"\*\zsem-i |x-unit="U1.8" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:1#12" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-உம் on வேலையாளுமாக"\*
\v 2 \x - \xo 1:2 \xt கொலோ 4:17\x*\w நம்முடைய|x-support="CONTEXT_SUPPORTED" x-reason="'our' with Apphia: no ἡμῶν here in any edition, but ἡμῶν governs the parallel Archippus phrase; KJV/OV tradition 'our beloved Apphia'"\w* \w உடன்|x-support="EXPLICITATION_SUPPORTED" x-reason="உடன் 'fellow-' — explicates Christian relationship"\w* \w விசுவாச|x-support="EXPLICITATION_SUPPORTED" x-reason="விசுவாச 'faith-' — explicates Christian relationship"\w* \w சகோதரி|x-support="SOURCE_SUPPORTED" x-reason="சகோதரி 'sister' : NA28 ἀδελφῇ; supported by NA28, NOT by TR (textual variant)"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U2.2" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:2#02" x-content="Ἀπφίᾳ" x-strong="G0682" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w அப்பியாளுக்கும்|strong="G2532,G0682,G3588" x-morph="CONJ,N-DSF-P,T-DSF" x-carrier="U2.1"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U2.7" x-type="REFERENT" x-src="PHM 1:2#09" x-content="ἡμῶν" x-strong="G3165" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w எங்களுடைய|strong="G3165" x-morph="P-1GP"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U2.6" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:2#07-08" x-content="τῷ συστρατιώτῃ" x-strong="G3588,G4961" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w உடன்|strong="G3588,G4961" x-morph="T-DSM,N-DSM"\w* \w போர்வீரனாகிய|strong="G3588,G4961" x-morph="T-DSM,N-DSM"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U2.5" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:2#06" x-content="Ἀρχίππῳ" x-strong="G0751" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w அர்க்கிப்புவிற்கும்|strong="G2532,G0751" x-morph="CONJ,N-DSM-P" x-carrier="U2.4"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U2.10" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:2#12-13-14" x-content="κατ᾽ οἶκόν σου" x-strong="G2596,G3624,G4771" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w உம்முடைய|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2GS"\w* \w வீட்டிலே|strong="G2596,G3624" x-morph="PREP,N-ASM"\w*\zsem-e\* \w கூடிவருகிற|x-support="EXPLICITATION_SUPPORTED" x-reason="கூடிவருகிற 'which gathers' — explicates κατ᾽ οἶκον ἐκκλησία"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U2.9" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:2#11-15" x-content="τῇ ἐκκλησίᾳ·" x-strong="G3588,G1577" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w சபை|strong="G2532,G3588,G1577" x-morph="CONJ,T-DSF,N-DSF"\w*\zsem-e\* \w விசுவாசிகளுக்கும்|x-carrier="U2.8" x-support="EXPLICITATION_SUPPORTED" x-reason="விசுவாசிகளுக்கும் 'to the believers' — explicates ἐκκλησία"\w* \w எழுதுகிறதாவது|x-support="EXPLICITATION_SUPPORTED" x-reason="எழுதுகிறதாவது 'writes as follows' — Tamil epistolary convention; letter opening has no verb in Greek"\w*:\zsem-i |x-unit="U2.1" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:2#01" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-உம் on அப்பியாளுக்கும்"\*\zsem-nl |x-unit="U2.3" x-type="ATTRIBUTE" x-src="PHM 1:2#03-04" x-content="τῇ ἀγαπητῇ" x-strong="G3588,G0027" x-cov="POSSIBLY_MISSING" x-scope="GREETING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-reason="TR ἀγαπητῇ 'beloved' has no realization; Tamil t4 சகோதரி 'sister' realizes the NA28 reading ἀδελφῇ instead. Base-text difference, not translation loss. Against NA28: COVERED."\*\zsem-i |x-unit="U2.4" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:2#05" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-உம் on அர்க்கிப்புவிற்கும்"\*\zsem-i |x-unit="U2.8" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:2#10" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-உம் on விசுவாசிகளுக்கும்"\*
\v 3 \zsem-s |x-unit="U3.5" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:3#05-06-07-08" x-content="ἀπὸ θεοῦ πατρὸς ἡμῶν" x-strong="G0575,G2316,G3962,G3165" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="ἀπό → instrumental -ஆலும்"\*\w நம்முடைய|strong="G3165" x-morph="P-1GP"\w* \w பிதாவாகிய|strong="G3962" x-morph="N-GSM-T"\w* \w தேவனாலும்|strong="G0575,G2316" x-morph="PREP,N-GSM-T" x-carrier="U3.6"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U3.7" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:3#10-11-12" x-content="κυρίου Ἰησοῦ Χριστοῦ.¶" x-strong="G2962,G2424,G5547" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w கர்த்தராகிய|strong="G2962" x-morph="N-GSM-T"\w* \w இயேசு|strong="G2424" x-morph="N-GSM-P"\w* \w கிறிஸ்துவினாலும்|strong="G2532,G5547" x-morph="CONJ,N-GSM-T" x-carrier="U3.6"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U3.2" x-type="REFERENT" x-src="PHM 1:3#02" x-content="ὑμῖν" x-strong="G4771" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w உங்களுக்குக்|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2DP"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U3.1" x-type="CONCEPT" x-src="PHM 1:3#01" x-content="χάρις" x-strong="G5485" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w கிருபையும்|strong="G5485" x-morph="N-NSF" x-carrier="U3.3"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U3.4" x-type="CONCEPT" x-src="PHM 1:3#04" x-content="εἰρήνη" x-strong="G1515" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w சமாதானமும்|strong="G2532,G1515" x-morph="CONJ,N-NSF" x-carrier="U3.3"\w*\zsem-e\* \w உண்டாவதாக|x-support="GRAMMATICALLY_REQUIRED" x-reason="optative copula உண்டாவதாக"\w*.\zsem-i |x-unit="U3.3" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:3#03" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-உம் … -உம்"\*\zsem-i |x-unit="U3.6" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:3#09" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="GREETING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-ஆலும் … -ஆலும்"\*
\s நன்றி கூறுதலும், ஜெபமும்
\p
\v 4 \zsem-s |x-unit="U5.7" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:5#10-11-12-13" x-content="πρὸς τὸν κύριον Ἰησοῦν" x-strong="G4314,G3588,G2962,G2424" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w கர்த்தராகிய|strong="G3588,G2962" x-morph="T-ASM,N-ASM-T"\w* \w இயேசுவிடம்|strong="G4314,G2424" x-morph="PREP,N-ASM-P"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U5.6" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:5#08-09" x-content="ἣν ἔχεις" x-strong="G3739,G2192" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE SPLIT" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED_WITH_RESTRUCTURING" x-dim="RELATION" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="ἣν ἔχεις governs both nouns in Greek; Tamil distributes: faith→Lord (உள்ள t3), love→saints (உள்ள t8). Chiastic reading, exegetically standard."\*\w உள்ள|strong="G3739,G2192" x-morph="R-ASF,V-PAI-2S"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U5.2" x-type="REFERENT" x-src="PHM 1:5#02" x-content="σου" x-strong="G4771" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE SPLIT DISCONTIGUOUS" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="σου distributed to both nouns (உம்முடைய … உம்முடைய)"\*\w உம்முடைய|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2GS"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U5.5" x-type="CONCEPT" x-src="PHM 1:5#06-07" x-content="τὴν πίστιν" x-strong="G3588,G4102" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w விசுவாசத்தையும்|strong="G2532,G3588,G4102" x-morph="CONJ,T-ASF,N-ASF" x-carrier="U5.4"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U5.9" x-type="QUANTITY" x-src="PHM 1:5#15-16-17-18" x-content="εἰς πάντας τοὺς ἁγίους," x-strong="G1519,G3956,G3588,G0040" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="QUANTITY" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="πάντας → எல்லாப் : quantity preserved"\*\w எல்லாப்|strong="G3956" x-morph="A-APM"\w* \w பரிசுத்தவான்களிடமும்|strong="G1519,G3588,G0040" x-morph="PREP,T-APM,A-APM" x-carrier="U5.8"\w*\zsem-e\* \w உள்ள|x-support="GRAMMATICALLY_REQUIRED" x-reason="participial copula உள்ள (second)"\w* \w உம்முடைய|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2GS"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U5.3" x-type="CONCEPT" x-src="PHM 1:5#03-04" x-content="τὴν ἀγάπην" x-strong="G3588,G0026" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w அன்பையும்|strong="G3588,G0026,G2532" x-morph="T-ASF,N-ASF,CONJ" x-carrier="U5.4 U5.8"\w*\zsem-e\* \w நான்|x-support="GRAMMATICALLY_REQUIRED" x-reason="subject நான்"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U5.1" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:5#01" x-content="ἀκούων" x-strong="G0191" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE REORDERED" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED_WITH_RESTRUCTURING" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w கேள்விப்பட்டு|strong="G0191" x-morph="V-PAP-NSM"\w*\zsem-e\*,
\v 5 \zsem-s |x-unit="U4.5" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:4#09-10-11-12" x-content="ἐπὶ τῶν προσευχῶν μου," x-strong="G1909,G3588,G4335,G3165" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w என்|strong="G3165" x-morph="P-1GS"\w* \w ஜெபங்களில்|strong="G1909,G3588,G4335" x-morph="PREP,T-GPF,N-GPF"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U4.4" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:4#06-07-08" x-content="μνείαν σου ποιούμενος" x-strong="G3417,G4771,G4160" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="LEXICAL_CONTENT" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="'making mention of you' → 'remembering you'; idiomatic equivalent"\*\w உம்மை|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2GS"\w* \w நினைத்து|strong="G3417,G4160" x-morph="N-ASF,V-PMP-NSM"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U4.3" x-type="TEMPORAL" x-src="PHM 1:4#05" x-content="πάντοτε" x-strong="G3842" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w எப்பொழுதும்|strong="G3842" x-morph="ADV"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U4.2" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:4#02-03-04" x-content="τῷ θεῷ μου" x-strong="G3588,G2316,G3165" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w என்|strong="G3165" x-morph="P-1GS"\w* \w தேவனுக்கு|strong="G3588,G2316" x-morph="T-DSM,N-DSM-T"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U4.1" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:4#01" x-content="Εὐχαριστῶ" x-strong="G2168" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE REORDERED" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED_WITH_RESTRUCTURING" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w நன்றி|strong="G2168" x-morph="V-PAI-1S"\w* \w செலுத்தி|strong="G2168" x-morph="V-PAI-1S"\w*\zsem-e\*,\zsem-i |x-unit="U5.4" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:5#05" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-உம் … -உம்"\*\zsem-i |x-unit="U5.8" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:5#14" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-உம் on பரிசுத்தவான்களிடமும்"\*
\v 6 \zsem-s |x-unit="U6.7" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:6#16-17-18" x-content="εἰς Χριστόν Ἰησοῦν." x-strong="G1519,G5547,G2424" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="SPLIT DISCONTIGUOUS" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED_WITH_RESTRUCTURING" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-variant="TR-differs-NA28" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="εἰς Χριστὸν Ἰησοῦν realized twice: locative கிறிஸ்துவில் (t1, modifying 'good in us') and telic கிறிஸ்து இயேசுவுக்காக (t10-11). TR-only Ἰησοῦν rendered." x-span="1/2"\*\w கிறிஸ்துவில்\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U6.6" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:6#13-14-15" x-content="τοῦ ἐν ὑμῖν" x-strong="G3588,G1722,G5213" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="MEANING_SHIFT" x-dim="REFERENT" x-cov="COVERED" x-vsna28="PRESERVED" x-variant="TR-differs-NA28" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="TR ὑμῖν 'in you (pl.)' → நமக்குள் 'in us' : NA28/Byz ἡμῖν. Against TR the referent shifts; against NA28 it is preserved. Textual, not translational."\*\w நமக்குள்|strong="G1722,G5213" x-morph="PREP,P-2DP"\w* \w உள்ள|strong="G3588" x-morph="T-GSN"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U6.5" x-type="QUANTITY" x-src="PHM 1:6#11-12" x-content="παντὸς ἀγαθοῦ" x-strong="G3956,G0018" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="QUANTITY" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="παντός → எல்லா"\*\w எல்லா|strong="G3956" x-morph="A-GSN"\w* \w நன்மைகளும்|strong="G0018" x-morph="A-GSN"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U6.4" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:6#09-10" x-content="ἐν ἐπιγνώσει" x-strong="G1722,G1922" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="MEANING_SHIFT" x-dim="RELATION" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="ἐν ἐπιγνώσει 'in/by the knowledge of' → தெரியப்படுகிறதினாலே 'because [it] is being made known': instrumental-locative becomes causal-passive. Meaning moves from Philemon knowing to the good being known."\*\w தெரியப்படுகிறதினாலே|strong="G1722,G1922" x-morph="PREP,N-DSF"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U6.2" x-type="CONCEPT" x-src="PHM 1:6#02-03-04-05-06" x-content="ἡ κοινωνία τῆς πίστεώς σου" x-strong="G3588,G2842,G3588,G4102,G4771" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w உம்முடைய|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2GS"\w* \w விசுவாசத்தின்|strong="G3588,G4102" x-morph="T-GSF,N-GSF"\w* \w ஐக்கியம்|strong="G3588,G2842" x-morph="T-NSF,N-NSF"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U6.7" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:6#16-17-18" x-content="εἰς Χριστόν Ἰησοῦν." x-strong="G1519,G5547,G2424" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="SPLIT DISCONTIGUOUS" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED_WITH_RESTRUCTURING" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-variant="TR-differs-NA28" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="εἰς Χριστὸν Ἰησοῦν realized twice: locative கிறிஸ்துவில் (t1, modifying 'good in us') and telic கிறிஸ்து இயேசுவுக்காக (t10-11). TR-only Ἰησοῦν rendered." x-span="2/2"\*\w கிறிஸ்து|strong="G5547" x-morph="N-ASM-T"\w* \w இயேசுவுக்காகப்|strong="G1519,G2424" x-morph="PREP,N-ASM-P"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U6.3" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:6#07-08" x-content="ἐνεργὴς γένηται" x-strong="G1756,G1096" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="MODALITY" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="subjunctive of purpose → வேண்டும் 'must/should'; acceptable"\*\w பயன்பட|strong="G1756,G1096" x-morph="A-NSF,V-2ADS-3S"\w* \w வேண்டும்|strong="G1756,G1096" x-morph="A-NSF,V-2ADS-3S"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U6.1" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:6#01" x-content="ὅπως" x-strong="G3704" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="என்று marks the content of the prayer"\*\w என்று|strong="G3704" x-morph="CONJ"\w*\zsem-e\* \w வேண்டுதல்|x-support="CONTEXT_SUPPORTED" x-reason="வேண்டுதல் 'petition' — the ὅπως clause depends on 1:4 προσευχῶν/μνείαν ποιούμενος; main verb supplied from passage"\w* \w செய்கிறேன்|x-support="CONTEXT_SUPPORTED" x-reason="செய்கிறேன் — as t15"\w*.
\v 7 \zsem-s |x-unit="U7.12" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:7#19" x-content="ἀδελφέ.¶" x-strong="G0080" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="REORDERED" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED_WITH_RESTRUCTURING" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="vocative moved to clause-initial"\*\w சகோதரனே|strong="G0080" x-morph="N-VSM"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U7.9" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:7#12-13-14-15" x-content="τὰ σπλάγχνα τῶν ἁγίων" x-strong="G3588,G4698,G3588,G0040" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w பரிசுத்தவான்களுடைய|strong="G3588,G0040" x-morph="T-GPM,A-GPM"\w* \w உள்ளங்கள்|strong="G3588,G4698" x-morph="T-NPN,N-NPN"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U7.11" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:7#17-18" x-content="διὰ σοῦ," x-strong="G1223,G4771" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w உம்மாலே|strong="G1223,G4771" x-morph="PREP,P-2GS"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U7.10" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:7#16" x-content="ἀναπέπαυται" x-strong="G0373" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="LEXICAL_CONTENT" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="'refreshed' → 'became encouraged'"\*\w உற்சாகமானதினால்|strong="G3754,G0373" x-morph="CONJ,V-RPI-3S" x-carrier="U7.8"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U7.7" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:7#07-08-09-10" x-content="ἐπὶ τῇ ἀγάπῃ σου," x-strong="G1909,G3588,G0026,G4771" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w உம்முடைய|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2GS"\w* \w அன்பினாலே|strong="G1909,G3588,G0026" x-morph="PREP,T-DSF,N-DSF"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U7.3" x-type="QUANTITY" x-src="PHM 1:7#03" x-content="πολλὴν" x-strong="G4183" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="QUANTITY" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w அதிக|strong="G4183" x-morph="A-ASF"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U7.1" x-type="CONCEPT" x-src="PHM 1:7#01" x-content="Χάριν" x-strong="G5485" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="MEANING_SHIFT" x-dim="LEXICAL_CONTENT" x-cov="COVERED" x-vsna28="PRESERVED" x-variant="TR-differs-NA28" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="TR χάριν 'thanks' → சந்தோஷம் 'joy' : NA28 χαράν. Textual."\*\w சந்தோஷமும்|strong="G5485,G2532" x-morph="N-ASF,CONJ" x-carrier="U7.5"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U7.6" x-type="CONCEPT" x-src="PHM 1:7#06" x-content="παράκλησιν" x-strong="G3874" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w ஆறுதலும்|strong="G3874" x-morph="N-ASF" x-carrier="U7.5"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U7.4" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:7#04" x-content="ἔχομεν" x-strong="G2192" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="MEANING_SHIFT" x-dim="PARTICIPANT" x-cov="COVERED" x-vsna28="PRESERVED" x-variant="TR-differs-NA28" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="TR ἔχομεν 'we have' (1 pl.) → அடைந்திருக்கிறேன் (1 sg.) : NA28 ἔσχον. Textual."\*\w அடைந்திருக்கிறேன்|strong="G2192" x-morph="V-PAI-1P"\w*\zsem-e\*.\zsem-i |x-unit="U7.2" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:7#02" x-content="γὰρ" x-strong="G1063" x-real="IMPLICIT" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="γάρ grounds v7 on v6; Tamil realizes the link by clause chaining (-ஆல் on உற்சாகமானதினால்)"\*\zsem-i |x-unit="U7.5" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:7#05" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-உம் … -உம்"\*\zsem-i |x-unit="U7.8" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:7#11" x-content="ὅτι" x-strong="G3754" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="THANKSGIVING" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="causal -ஆல் on உற்சாகமானதினால்"\*
\s ஒநேசிமுக்காக பவுலின் மன்றாடல்
\p
\v 8 \zsem-s |x-unit="U8.1" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:8#01" x-content="Διὸ" x-strong="G1352" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w ஆகவே|strong="G1352" x-morph="CONJ"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U9.5" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:9#08-09" x-content="ὡς Παῦλος" x-strong="G5613,G3972" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE REORDERED" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w பவுலாகிய|strong="G5613,G3972" x-morph="PRT,N-NSM-P"\w*\zsem-e\* \w நான்|x-support="GRAMMATICALLY_REQUIRED" x-reason="subject நான்"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U9.6" x-type="ATTRIBUTE" x-src="PHM 1:9#10" x-content="πρεσβύτης" x-strong="G4246" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE REORDERED" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="πρεσβύτης 'aged'; IRV footnote offers 'ambassador' (πρεσβευτής)"\*\w முதிர்|strong="G4246" x-morph="N-NSM"\w* \w வயதானவனாகவும்|strong="G4246" x-morph="N-NSM"\w*\zsem-e\*\f + \fr 1:8 \fq முதிர் வயதானவனாகவும் \ft அல்லது: பிரதிநிதி. \f*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U9.10" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:9#14-15-16" x-content="δέσμιος Χριστοῦ Ἰησοῦ·" x-strong="G1198,G5547,G2424" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE REORDERED" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="Tamil order 'Jesus Christ'; TR order Χριστοῦ Ἰησοῦ (order-variant flagged in source)"\*\w இயேசு|strong="G2424" x-morph="N-GSM-P"\w* \w கிறிஸ்துவுக்காக|strong="G5547" x-morph="N-GSM-T"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U9.7" x-type="TEMPORAL" x-src="PHM 1:9#11" x-content="νυνὶ" x-strong="G3570" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE REORDERED" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w இப்பொழுது|strong="G3570" x-morph="ADV"\w*\zsem-e\* \w சிறைச்சாலையில்|strong="G2532,G1198" x-morph="CONJ,N-NSM"\w* \w கட்டப்பட்டவனாகவும்|strong="G2532,G1198" x-morph="CONJ,N-NSM" x-carrier="U9.9"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U9.4" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:9#06-07" x-content="τοιοῦτος ὢν" x-strong="G5108,G1510" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE REORDERED" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED_WITH_RESTRUCTURING" x-dim="RELATION" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="τοιοῦτος ὤν 'being such' → இருக்கிறதினால் 'since I am' — causal made explicit"\*\w இருக்கிறதினால்|strong="G5108,G1510" x-morph="D-NSM,V-PAP-NSM"\w*\zsem-e\*,\zsem-nl |x-unit="U8.2" x-type="QUANTITY" x-src="PHM 1:8#02" x-content="πολλὴν" x-strong="G4183" x-cov="POSSIBLY_MISSING" x-scope="APPEAL" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-reason="πολλήν 'much [boldness]' — searched 1:8–1:9; துணிவுள்ளவனாக 'bold' has no degree word. QUANTITY."\*
\v 9 \zsem-s |x-unit="U8.8" x-type="CONCEPT" x-src="PHM 1:8#09-10" x-content="τὸ ἀνῆκον" x-strong="G3588,G0433" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="'what is fitting' → 'what you ought to do'"\*\w நீர்\w* \w செய்ய|strong="G3588,G0433" x-morph="T-ASN,V-PAP-ASN"\w* \w வேண்டியதை|strong="G3588,G0433" x-morph="T-ASN,V-PAP-ASN"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U8.7" x-type="REFERENT" x-src="PHM 1:8#08" x-content="σοι" x-strong="G4771" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w உமக்குக்|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2DS"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U8.6" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:8#07" x-content="ἐπιτάσσειν" x-strong="G2004" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w கட்டளையிடுவதற்குக்|strong="G2004" x-morph="V-PAN"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U8.3" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:8#03-04" x-content="ἐν Χριστῷ" x-strong="G1722,G5547" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w கிறிஸ்துவிற்குள்|strong="G1722,G5547" x-morph="PREP,N-DSM-T"\w*\zsem-e\* \w நான்|x-support="GRAMMATICALLY_REQUIRED" x-reason="subject நான்"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U8.4" x-type="CONCEPT" x-src="PHM 1:8#05" x-content="παρρησίαν" x-strong="G3954" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w துணிவுள்ளவனாக|strong="G3954,G2192" x-morph="N-ASF,V-PAP-NSM"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U8.5" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:8#06" x-content="ἔχων" x-strong="G2192" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED_WITH_RESTRUCTURING" x-dim="RELATION" x-cov="COVERED_BY_RESTRUCTURING" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="participle ἔχων → concessive இருந்தாலும் 'although I am'; concession is implicit in Greek (bold … rather I appeal)"\*\w இருந்தாலும்|strong="G3954,G2192" x-morph="N-ASF,V-PAP-NSM"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U9.2" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:9#04" x-content="μᾶλλον" x-strong="G3123" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED_WITH_RESTRUCTURING" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="μᾶλλον 'rather' → அப்படிச் செய்யாமல் 'not doing so, [instead]'"\*\w அப்படிச்|strong="G3123" x-morph="ADV"\w* \w செய்யாமல்|strong="G3123" x-morph="ADV"\w*\zsem-e\*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U9.1" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:9#01-02-03" x-content="διὰ τὴν ἀγάπην" x-strong="G1223,G3588,G0026" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w அன்பினாலே|strong="G1223,G3588,G0026" x-morph="PREP,T-ASF,N-ASF"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U9.3" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:9#05" x-content="παρακαλῶ," x-strong="G3870" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w மன்றாடுகிறேன்|strong="G3870" x-morph="V-PAI-1S"\w*\zsem-e\*.\zsem-i |x-unit="U9.8" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:9#12" x-content="δὲ" x-strong="G1161" x-real="IMPLICIT" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="δέ — contrast carried by clause order"\*\zsem-i |x-unit="U9.9" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:9#13" x-content="καὶ" x-strong="G2532" x-real="GRAMMATICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="CROSS_VERSE REORDERED" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="-உம் on கட்டப்பட்டவனாகவும்"\*
\v 10 \x - \xo 1:10 \xt கொலோ 4:9\x*\w என்னவென்றால்|x-support="CONTEXT_SUPPORTED" x-reason="என்னவென்றால் 'that is:' — introduces the content of the appeal (v10 resumes v9 παρακαλῶ)"\w*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U10.4" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:10#09-10-11-12" x-content="ἐν τοῖς δεσμοῖς μου," x-strong="G1722,G3588,G1199,G3165" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="REFERENT" x-cov="COVERED" x-variant="TR-differs-NA28" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="TR-only μου 'my' not separately rendered; possessor recoverable from context → PRESERVED"\*\w சிறைச்சாலையில்|strong="G3588,G1199" x-morph="T-DPM,N-DPM"\w* \w கட்டப்பட்டிருக்கும்|strong="G3588,G1199" x-morph="T-DPM,N-DPM"\w* \w போது|strong="G1722" x-morph="PREP"\w*\zsem-e\* \w விசுவாசத்தில்|x-support="EXPLICITATION_SUPPORTED" x-reason="விசுவாசத்தில் 'in faith' — explicates the spiritual sense of ἐγέννησα; IRV footnotes it"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U10.2" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:10#03-04-05-06" x-content="περὶ τοῦ ἐμοῦ τέκνου" x-strong="G4012,G3588,G1473,G5043" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="περί → -க்காக on ஒநேசிமுக்காக (t8)"\*\w எனக்கு|strong="G1473" x-morph="S-1SGSN"\w* \w மகனாகிய|strong="G3588,G5043,G3739,G1080" x-morph="T-GSN,N-GSN,R-ASM,V-AAI-1S" x-carrier="U10.3"\w*\zsem-e\*\f + \fr 1:10 \fq விசுவாசத்தில் எனக்கு மகனாகிய \ft விசுவாசத்தில் நான் பெற்ற மகனாகிய\f* \zsem-s |x-unit="U10.5" x-type="PARTICIPANT" x-src="PHM 1:10#13" x-content="Ὀνήσιμον," x-strong="G3682" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w ஒநேசிமுக்காக|strong="G4012,G3682" x-morph="PREP,N-ASM-P"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U10.1" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:10#01-02" x-content="παρακαλῶ σε" x-strong="G3870,G4771" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w உம்மை|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2AS"\w* \w மன்றாடுகிறேன்|strong="G3870" x-morph="V-PAI-1S"\w*\zsem-e\*.\zsem-i |x-unit="U10.3" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:10#07-08" x-content="ὃν ἐγέννησα" x-strong="G3739,G1080" x-real="IMPLICIT" x-props="MERGED" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PARTIAL" x-dim="LEXICAL_CONTENT" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="ἐγέννησα 'I begot' merged into மகனாகிய 'who is (my) son'; the begetting event becomes a state. Tamil adds விசுவாசத்தில் 'in faith' to carry the spiritual sense (see support)."\*
\v 11 \zsem-s |x-unit="U11.2" x-type="TEMPORAL" x-src="PHM 1:11#02" x-content="ποτέ" x-strong="G4218" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w முன்னே|strong="G4218" x-morph="PRT"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U11.1" x-type="REFERENT" x-src="PHM 1:11#01" x-content="τόν" x-strong="G3588" x-real="PRONOMINALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="τόν (article as relative) → அவன்"\*\w அவன்|strong="G3588" x-morph="T-ASM"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U11.3" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:11#03-04" x-content="σοι ἄχρηστον" x-strong="G4771,G0890" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w உமக்குப்|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2DS"\w* \w பயனில்லாதவனாக|strong="G0890" x-morph="A-ASM"\w*\zsem-e\* \w இருந்தான்|x-support="GRAMMATICALLY_REQUIRED" x-reason="copula இருந்தான்"\w*, \zsem-s |x-unit="U11.4" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:11#05-06" x-content="νυνὶ δὲ" x-strong="G3570,G1161" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="இப்பொழுதோ — δέ as contrastive -ஓ"\*\w இப்பொழுதோ|strong="G3570,G1161" x-morph="ADV,CONJ"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U11.5" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:11#08-09-10-11" x-content="σοὶ καὶ ἐμοὶ εὔχρηστον," x-strong="G4771,G2532,G1473,G2173" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w உமக்கும்|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2DS"\w* \w எனக்கும்|strong="G2532,G1473" x-morph="CONJ,P-1DS"\w* \w பயனுள்ளதாக|strong="G2173" x-morph="A-ASM"\w*\zsem-e\* \w இருக்கிறான்|x-support="GRAMMATICALLY_REQUIRED" x-reason="copula இருக்கிறான்"\w*.
\v 12 \zsem-s |x-unit="U12.1" x-type="REFERENT" x-src="PHM 1:12#01" x-content="ὃν" x-strong="G3739" x-real="PRONOMINALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w அவனை|strong="G3739" x-morph="R-ASM"\w*\zsem-e\* \w நான்|x-support="GRAMMATICALLY_REQUIRED" x-reason="subject நான்"\w* \w உம்மிடம்|x-support="CONTEXT_SUPPORTED" x-reason="உம்மிடம் 'to you' — the direction encoded in ἀνα-πέμπω 'send back'"\w* \zsem-s |x-unit="U12.2" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:12#02" x-content="ἀνέπεμψά" x-strong="G0375" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="TEMPORAL_ASPECTUAL" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="epistolary aorist → present அனுப்புகிறேன் (correct); 'back' (ἀνα-) carried by உம்மிடம் (see support)"\*\w அனுப்புகிறேன்|strong="G0375" x-morph="V-AAI-1S"\w*\zsem-e\*; \zsem-s |x-unit="U12.6" x-type="RELATION" x-src="PHM 1:12#06-07-08-09-10" x-content="τοῦτ᾽ ἔστιν τὰ ἐμὰ σπλάγχνα" x-strong="G3778,G1510,G3588,G1473,G4698" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED_WITH_RESTRUCTURING" x-dim="LEXICAL_CONTENT" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="identity 'that is, my very heart' → simile 'who is like my heart' (போல்); metaphor softened"\*\w என்|strong="G1473" x-morph="S-1SAPN"\w* \w இருதயம்|strong="G3588,G4698" x-morph="T-APN,N-APN"\w* \w போல்|strong="G3778,G1510" x-morph="D-NSN,V-PAI-3S"\w* \w இருக்கிற|strong="G3778,G1510" x-morph="D-NSN,V-PAI-3S"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U12.5" x-type="REFERENT" x-src="PHM 1:12#05" x-content="αὐτόν," x-strong="G0846" x-real="PRONOMINALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w அவனை|strong="G0846" x-morph="P-ASM"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U12.3" x-type="REFERENT" x-src="PHM 1:12#03" x-content="σὺ" x-strong="G4771" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-variant="TR-differs-NA28" x-review="AI_PROPOSED"\*\w நீர்|strong="G4771" x-morph="P-2NS"\w*\zsem-e\* \zsem-s |x-unit="U12.7" x-type="EVENT" x-src="PHM 1:12#11" x-content="προσλαβοῦ." x-strong="G4355" x-real="LEXICALLY_REALIZED" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-variant="TR-differs-NA28" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="TR-only προσλαβοῦ rendered — evidence for TR base here"\*\w ஏற்றுக்கொள்ளும்|strong="G4355" x-morph="V-2AMM-2S"\w*\zsem-e\*.\zsem-i |x-unit="U12.4" x-type="DISCOURSE" x-src="PHM 1:12#04" x-content="δὲ" x-strong="G1161" x-real="IMPLICIT" x-props="" x-scope="APPEAL" x-s7="PRESERVED" x-dim="" x-cov="COVERED" x-variant="TR-differs-NA28" x-review="AI_PROPOSED" x-note="TR-only δέ; no contrast lost"\*
